<title>USA: Data General Q4 shr rises to $0.24.</title>
<headline>Data General Q4 shr rises to $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.24   profit	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net	profit	  9,900   profit	 1,500</p>
<p> Revs		     336,200		  312,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,100		   39,200</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.68     loss	 $1.23</p>
<p> Net    profit	   28,100     loss	46,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,322,300		1,159,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,100		   37,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus estimate was $0.19 per share earnings for the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The 1995 fiscal year includes $43 million restructuring charge for workforce reduction.</p>
<p>Full company name is Data General Corp.</p>
